hashing scheme, and the behaviour of the referenced CVEs that informs the
analysis in docs/dahua-p2p-security-analysis.md was derived from studying that
original GPL-licensed project. Credit for that protocol reverse-engineering
belongs to its author.

This repository is a defensive derivative. The security write-up in
docs/ and the single-device hardening tool in cmd/dahua-audit are original work
by the maintainer of this repository and contain no offensive capability (no
P2P/cloud reachability, no serial enumeration, no CVE exploitation, and no
account creation). As a derivative of GPL-3.0 work, this repository is likewise
distributed under GPL-3.0 (see LICENSE).
